            "review_title": "Review at Cuisine Pallet BBQ",
            "review_text": "Jrdd4\nMadrid, Spain9 contributions\n0\nDissapointed\nJul 2019 • Friends\nOur worst dinner in Vietnam in 3 weeks. Place looked nice so we gave it a try, but were really dissappointed. Prices are not expensive but not cheap either. I waited for 40 min for just stir fried chicken wings.Obviously when they came I was not hungry at all and did not eat a single bit, also they did not look really good. Even that the manager saw I had not eat anythiny he did not even asked or apologise for the wait. Overall, very poor service. I don't recommend at all.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 9, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
