            "review_title": "Review at Cuisine Pallet BBQ",
            "review_text": "kimpy15\nBedford, United Kingdom9 contributions\n0\nBbq fun!\nMay 2019 • Couples\nWe ended up at this bbq restaurant due to its vicinity to our hotel. Its located close to the beach tucked away down a side road.\nThe two of us ordered a seafood rice and some meat to bbq - 5 spice beef, chicken and prawns.\nAll were delicious but especially the beef!! We had 3 meats, the rice and 4 beers between us and it was only less than the equivalent of £15 which we think is very reasonable! The girl working there was also very friendly and helpful :) we might try and find time to return before we leave Da Nang\nRead more\nWritten May 29, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
