            "review_title": "Review at Cuisine Pallet BBQ",
            "review_text": "Tegan M\n109 contributions\n0\nThe most tender beef\nMar 2019 • Couples\nKorean BBQ experience means some of the dishes you get to cook at your table. It’s a fun experience though. There are also cooked meals available too. We tried both and have to say it was the most tender servings of meat we’ve had in Vietnam. Absolutely delicious. The serves are a little small for a big mans belly but the price is right compared to other Korean BBQ restaurants in the area so you can keep ordering different dishes until you’re full. The young man that served us was absolutely delightful and friendly. We will be back! Oh and the beer prices are the best we’ve seen too.\nRead more\nWritten March 29, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
