            "review_text": "chrisoula q\nAthens, Greece112 contributions\n2\nFabulous\nDec 2018 • Couples\nWe happened across this wonderful restaurant by chance and so glad we did. The staff are very welcoming and attentive. It's a nice modern design. But the best of all is the food. We had the tastiest tender melt in your mouth beef. There are several choices to grill at your table. Lovely fresh vegetables and sides. All served with various sauces and dips. It was very good value too. I highly recommend. We will definitely be going back.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 25, 2018",
